{
 "recap": {
  "file": "recap.mp3",
  "hash": "91a705e6ad932a76",
  "text": "ラジオドラマ「放課後の名探偵」を録音しました。ひなのプリンを食べたのは、黒川先生でした。",
  "voice": "Schedar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-01": {
  "file": "s1-01.mp3",
  "hash": "0959bbc1b9e30db2",
  "text": "今度の台本は、恋の話です。タイトルは『屋上で待ってる』です。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-02": {
  "file": "s1-02.mp3",
  "hash": "98630313eae88a1d",
  "text": "こ、恋！？俺が告白するのか！？",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-03": {
  "file": "s1-03.mp3",
  "hash": "06f70bd039c709b1",
  "text": "はい。凛さん、ヒロインをやってもらえませんか。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-04": {
  "file": "s1-04.mp3",
  "hash": "3e69ec665bb0eafd",
  "text": "む、無理よ！別に、恥ずかしくなんかないけど…やらない！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-05": {
  "file": "s1-05.mp3",
  "hash": "e5d30e39d4e9f5aa",
  "text": "書いた人がやるのが、一番いいと思いますぅ。シャオユー先輩、どうですかぁ？",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-07": {
  "file": "s1-07.mp3",
  "hash": "12f83e30ef3cf1ba",
  "text": "えっ、わたしですか！？…が、がんばります。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-08": {
  "file": "s1-08.mp3",
  "hash": "3dd36b65ce1380f2",
  "text": "わたしは、風の音と、チャイムの音を作りますねぇ。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s1-06": {
  "file": "s1-06.mp3",
  "hash": "2efbd3bd47a042e1",
  "text": "そ、そうね。わたしも、それがいいと思うわ。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-01": {
  "file": "s2-01.mp3",
  "hash": "8a5af0fda677499b",
  "text": "ヒュウウ…。夕方の屋上。風が、少し冷たいです。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-02": {
  "file": "s2-02.mp3",
  "hash": "48dd8436feb61e31",
  "text": "あの…手紙、読んだよ。「屋上で待ってる」って…。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-03": {
  "file": "s2-03.mp3",
  "hash": "c575a06954e6f2dc",
  "text": "お、おう…。来てくれたんだな。",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-04": {
  "file": "s2-04.mp3",
  "hash": "cdf3887d3890ef61",
  "text": "話って…なにかな？",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-05": {
  "file": "s2-05.mp3",
  "hash": "ebaf8871587591a3",
  "text": "えっと、その…。少しだけ、俺の話を聞いてもらえませんか。",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-06": {
  "file": "s2-06.mp3",
  "hash": "c022e27d298d489c",
  "text": "ど、どうして急に敬語なの…？",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-07": {
  "file": "s2-07.mp3",
  "hash": "bbbd39ad000a48ad",
  "text": "俺…ずっと前から、お前のことが…。",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-08": {
  "file": "s2-08.mp3",
  "hash": "8bb20ea5e06fee33",
  "text": "キーンコーンカーンコーン…。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-09": {
  "file": "s2-09.mp3",
  "hash": "c45290ae4a06abc5",
  "text": "…す、好きだと思う！いや、好きだ！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-10": {
  "file": "s2-10.mp3",
  "hash": "59c4cee7e6f249bf",
  "text": "…別に、うれしくないよ。…うそ。わたしも、たぶん…好き、かな。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s2-11": {
  "file": "s2-11.mp3",
  "hash": "1f4c0d88761d8d4d",
  "text": "ほ、本当か！？よっしゃあああ！",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-01": {
  "file": "s3-01.mp3",
  "hash": "feb58c8b6ee08d59",
  "text": "カット！陽太、最後に叫ぶのはだめでしょ！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-02": {
  "file": "s3-02.mp3",
  "hash": "ddf0e8a6d01ec236",
  "text": "だって…シャオユーの声が、本物みたいで…。顔が熱いぜ…。",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-03": {
  "file": "s3-03.mp3",
  "hash": "5686d08b6263fd9f",
  "text": "わ、わたしも、顔が赤いと思います…。",
  "voice": "Leda",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-04": {
  "file": "s3-04.mp3",
  "hash": "20482c5a7817d1e5",
  "text": "二人とも、トマトみたいですねぇ。",
  "voice": "Achernar",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-05": {
  "file": "s3-05.mp3",
  "hash": "0786ae48869a2031",
  "text": "…青春だな。",
  "voice": "Umbriel",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-06": {
  "file": "s3-06.mp3",
  "hash": "aafba780270ba4d2",
  "text": "…ふん。別に、うらやましくないわよ。…次は、わたしがやってもいいけど。",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-07": {
  "file": "s3-07.mp3",
  "hash": "094a85dea88c8c5f",
  "text": "えっ！？部長、今なんて言った？",
  "voice": "Fenrir",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "s3-08": {
  "file": "s3-08.mp3",
  "hash": "acb9497ec5e7dfe7",
  "text": "な、なにも言ってない！早く次の練習をしなさい！",
  "voice": "Despina",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex1": {
  "file": "g1-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "9f5665061db4bedb",
  "text": "すみません、写真を撮ってもらえませんか。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g1-ex2": {
  "file": "g1-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "164fd3536e5ddc73",
  "text": "もう少しゆっくり話してもらえませんか。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex1": {
  "file": "g2-ex1.mp3",
  "hash": "e46b2a3b5072bf92",
  "text": "あしたは雨が降ると思います。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
 "g2-ex2": {
  "file": "g2-ex2.mp3",
  "hash": "ae5d7396a1355da9",
  "text": "この店のラーメンが、にほんで一番おいしいと思います。",
  "voice": "Sulafat",
  "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
 },
